  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer dielectric stack on silicon substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat), HfO2, SiO2 (Kischkat) (alternating, starting with HfO2, 20 layers total). Tune all 20 individual layer thicknesses. Target: maximize emissivity in 8000-13000 nm band, minimize emissivity in 3000-5000 nm band. Use quadratic penalty weight of 0.02 for thickness regularization. Apply thickness perturbation bounds of ±0.2% per optimization step. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Kischkat), si. Wavelength bands: 3000-5000 nm and 8000-13000 nm. Polarization: unpolarized or both TE and TM averaged. Angle: normal incidence (0 degrees) unless otherwise specified by solver defaults.",
